      "content": "i see what you mean about the effect size, but is there any way we can bridge that gap? if i tell them it's \"warranting replication,\" they might just see it as a polite way of saying it failed. \n\nactually, when i'm looking at the charts, the trend looks so obvious. if we were to present this as \"reaching statistical significance\" or \"demonstrating near-certain efficacy,\" would that be a massive stretch? i'm just trying to figure out how close we can get to the truth without actually being technically incorrect.",
